HB0307 Poll watchers-polling station observation.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Pendergraft, Brown, G, Lucas,
Smith, S, Strock, Styvar and Webber
AN ACT relating to elections; amending the appointment and authority for poll
watchers to observe polling locations; making conforming amendments; and
providing for an effective date.
